<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1862102742"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1575427864"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="YY"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ロイ-RöE-"/><amll:meta key="album" value="YY"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:21.004"><div begin="00:14.890" end="03:21.044"><p begin="00:14.890" end="00:18.586" itunes:key="L36049">きっとどれも相応しいや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定每一个都很适合</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to do re mo fu sa wa shi i ya</span></p><p begin="00:18.596" end="00:22.298" itunes:key="L36066">YY 心騒いで居たいわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想让内心也躁动起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">YY ko ko ro sa wa i de i ta i wa</span></p><p begin="00:22.308" end="00:25.961" itunes:key="L36050">君と笑顔わけあえたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你一同扬起笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to e ga o wa ke a e ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:25.971" end="00:44.343" itunes:key="L36067">I'm on Cloud nine (Wa-ha-ha)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我如身处九霄云外</span></p><p begin="00:29.553" end="00:33.348" itunes:key="L36051">You gave me a lively world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给了我一个鲜活的世界</span></p><p begin="00:33.358" end="00:36.898" itunes:key="L36068">Every day with you is special<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你在一起的每一天都很特别</span></p><p begin="00:36.980" end="00:40.515" itunes:key="L36867">You gave me a lively world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给了我一个鲜活的世界</span></p><p begin="00:40.750" end="00:44.625" itunes:key="L36830">Every day with you is special<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你在一起的每一天都很特别</span></p><p begin="00:46.337" end="00:50.086" itunes:key="L36052">デタラメな愛で間に合えば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果毫无道理的爱还足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de ta ra me na a i de ma ni a e ba</span></p><p begin="00:50.176" end="00:53.788" itunes:key="L36069">もやのなか 目を凝らさないのだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷雾之中 眼神无法凝聚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo ya no na ka me wo ko ra sa na i no da</span></p><p begin="00:53.865" end="00:57.492" itunes:key="L36070">ロマンで箱詰めにしちゃえば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用浪漫装满箱子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro ma n de ha ko zu me ni shi cha e ba</span></p><p begin="00:57.560" end="01:01.574" itunes:key="L36071">むねのなか 使い道ばっかだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中会有无数使用方法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne no na ka tsu ka i mi chi ba 'k ka da</span></p><p begin="01:01.646" end="01:07.404" itunes:key="L36053">この世界ごと味わい尽くしたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要尝尽这个世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no se ka i go to a ji wa i tsu ku shi ta i</span></p><p begin="01:09.212" end="01:15.643" itunes:key="L36072">ひととおり ふたとおり Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh, Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一条路 两条路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to to o ri fu ta to o ri</span></p><p begin="01:15.959" end="01:19.394" itunes:key="L36054">YY I want you to stay by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你能留在我身边</span></p><p begin="01:19.404" end="01:23.300" itunes:key="L36073">足りないモノなどまるでないわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎没有任何不满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i mo no na do ma ru de na i wa</span></p><p begin="01:23.474" end="01:26.910" itunes:key="L36074">君と笑顔わけあえたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你一同扬起笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to e ga o wa ke a e ta ra</span></p><p begin="01:27.073" end="01:43.305" itunes:key="L36055">I'm on Cloud nine (Wa-ha-ha)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我如身处九霄云外</span></p><p begin="01:30.389" end="01:34.216" itunes:key="L36056">You gave me a lively world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给了我一个鲜活的世界</span></p><p begin="01:34.390" end="01:37.878" itunes:key="L36075">Every day with you is special<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你在一起的每一天都很特别</span></p><p begin="01:37.983" end="01:41.443" itunes:key="L43924">You gave me a lively world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给了我一个鲜活的世界</span></p><p begin="01:41.623" end="01:45.207" itunes:key="L43888">Every day with you is special<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你在一起的每一天都很特别</span></p><p begin="01:47.435" end="01:51.139" itunes:key="L36057">意地っ張りな言葉たちは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是固执的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ji 'p pa ri na ko to ba ta chi wa</span></p><p begin="01:51.169" end="01:54.716" itunes:key="L36058">イージーを難解に変えてしまうのだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让简单的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i i ji i wo</span></p><p begin="01:54.747" end="01:58.294" itunes:key="L36059">だけど紐解くこの性質だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我就是这样的性格</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do hi mo to ku ko no sa ga da</span></p><p begin="01:58.336" end="02:02.379" itunes:key="L36060">何はともあれ異なってイイの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何 还是各不相同更好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni wa to mo a re ko to na 't te i i no</span></p><p begin="02:02.495" end="02:08.233" itunes:key="L36061">邪魔しないで 騙し合いじゃ待てない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要来妨碍我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja ma shi na i de</span></p><p begin="02:10.119" end="02:17.265" itunes:key="L36076">ひとたび 再びない奇跡を君と二人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次又一次 与你一同创造奇迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ta bi fu ta ta bi na i ki se ki wo ki mi to fu ta ri</span></p><p begin="02:31.702" end="02:35.075" itunes:key="L36062">You gave me a lively world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给了我一个鲜活的世界</span></p><p begin="02:35.142" end="02:38.641" itunes:key="L36077">Every day, with you is special<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你在一起的每一天都很特别</span></p><p begin="02:38.714" end="02:42.341" itunes:key="L45079">You gave me a lively world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给了我一个鲜活的世界</span></p><p begin="02:42.351" end="02:46.040" itunes:key="L45041">Every day, with you is special<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你在一起的每一天都很特别</span></p><p begin="02:46.284" end="02:53.651" itunes:key="L36063">曇り空も上の空 YY心騒いで居るんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阴沉天空也心不在焉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku mo ri zo ra mo u wa no so ra</span></p><p begin="02:53.661" end="03:16.174" itunes:key="L36078">つもりつもるetc... I'm on Cloud nine (Wa-ha-ha)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断积累 我如身处九霄云外</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mo ri tsu mo ru etc I'm on Cloud nine</span></p><p begin="03:01.113" end="03:04.678" itunes:key="L36064">YY I want you to stay by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你能留在我身边</span></p><p begin="03:04.688" end="03:08.396" itunes:key="L36065">如何しようもなくてへっちゃらよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无可奈何 满不在乎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi yo u mo na ku te he 'c cha ra yo</span></p><p begin="03:08.406" end="03:12.019" itunes:key="L36079">君とアンバランスなダンス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你跳起不平衡的舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to a n ba ra n su na da n su</span></p><p begin="03:12.029" end="03:15.804" itunes:key="L36080">I'm on Cloud nine (Wa-ha-ha)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我如身处九霄云外</span></p><p begin="03:15.888" end="03:21.044" itunes:key="L45878">I'm on Cloud nine (Wa-ha-ha)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我如身处九霄云外</span></p></div></body></tt>